 "stem": "In the mobile puzzle game *Tidepool Tiles*, the time taken, $T$ seconds, by a player on their first attempt at Level 12 is modelled by $T \\sim \\mathrm{N}(84, 11^2)$.\n\nA player who clears the level in under 70 seconds wins a gold badge. A player whose time is between 70 and 95 seconds wins a silver badge. Anyone slower wins no badge.",
